Google Play APK Downloader

This project is an unofficial, static browser client maintained by Basil-AS.
It is not affiliated with Google LLC, Aurora Store or the relay provider.

Runtime third-party services/libraries:
- Google Play Android FDFE / Google CDN: https://android.clients.google.com/
- Aurora anonymous authentication dispenser: https://auroraoss.com/api/auth
- corsproxy.io public CORS relay: https://corsproxy.io/
- JSZip 3.10.1 loaded from jsDelivr: https://www.jsdelivr.com/package/npm/jszip

APKCombo, APKPure, APKMirror and other APK mirrors/catalogues are not used by the application.

The project does not operate a backend server and does not request or store a user's personal Google credentials. Temporary anonymous auth data is stored in the user's browser cache. External services remain subject to their own terms, availability, logging and licenses.

AI-assisted engineering attribution is documented in CONTRIBUTORS.md and relevant commit trailers.
